---
// No approved real customer testimonials exist in this repository.
// Per this stage's explicit instruction, this section must never
// fabricate customer names, quotes, ratings, or locations - it shows an
// honest, professionally-worded absence state instead of dummy review
// content. Replace this component's body (not its heading/section
// structure) once real, owner-approved testimonials exist.
---

<section class="testimonials" aria-labelledby="testimonials-heading">
  <div class="container-wide">
    <h2 id="testimonials-heading" class="section-heading">Customer Reviews</h2>
    <div class="testimonials-placeholder" data-dev-placeholder="true">
      <p>Customer reviews will appear here once approved, real testimonials are available.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .testimonials {
    padding-block: var(--space-7);
  }

  .testimonials-placeholder {
    max-width: 32rem;
    padding: var(--space-5);
    margin-block-start: var(--space-4);
    text-align: center;
    color: var(--color-charcoal-600);
    background-color: var(--color-cream-100);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
  }
</style>
